<!DOCTYPE html><!-- Last Published: Fri Sep 11 2026 12:38:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time) --><html data-wf-domain="www2.hustlefund.vc" data-wf-page="641065e7b5f96375a9b06d5e" data-wf-site="6331a9a50eb8aa687c52dd23" lang="en" data-wf-collection="641065e7b5f963d0e6b06d10" data-wf-item-slug="angel-squad-anthropic-pre-ipo-shares-what-accredited-investors-should-know-in-2026"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><title>Anthropic Pre-IPO Shares: What Accredited Investors Should Know in 2026 | Hustle Fund</title><meta content="Anthropic just crossed a trillion dollars on the secondary market, up nearly 890% in a year. The revenue is real and growing more than 10x annually, but you would be buying at roughly 70x a $14 billion run rate, about 6% above a round that is one week old. Here is the math." name="description"/><meta content="Anthropic Pre-IPO Shares: What Accredited Investors Should Know in 2026 | Hustle Fund" property="og:title"/><meta content="Anthropic just crossed a trillion dollars on the secondary market, up nearly 890% in a year. The revenue is real and growing more than 10x annually, but you would be buying at roughly 70x a $14 billion run rate, about 6% above a round that is one week old. Here is the math." property="og:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6a47636b5b529b220c97a791_Minimum%20Cheque%20Size%20-%202026-07-03T032238.043.png" property="og:image"/><meta content="Anthropic Pre-IPO Shares: What Accredited Investors Should Know in 2026 | Hustle Fund" name="twitter:title"/><meta content="Anthropic just crossed a trillion dollars on the secondary market, up nearly 890% in a year. The revenue is real and growing more than 10x annually, but you would be buying at roughly 70x a $14 billion run rate, about 6% above a round that is one week old. Here is the math." name="twitter:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6a47636b5b529b220c97a791_Minimum%20Cheque%20Size%20-%202026-07-03T032238.043.png" name="twitter:image"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><meta content="bDPYQHaj1zhft92BesqlN0OIM98O_txPBT4SW5qa9yM" name="google-site-verification"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa687c52dd23/css/hustle-fund.webflow.shared.67da893e7.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" integrity="sha384-Z9qJPnxQY/BYUDAfkz/z1+Djfj9+lNimzhQrjVv6V3+tS8RnJwdWpGEa8ZcfSsPR" crossorigin="anonymous"/><style>@media (min-width:992px) {html.w-mod-js:not(.w-mod-ix) [data-w-id="c288d165-b165-99cf-7c9c-3ac8f8ca0f7a"] {opacity:0;display:none;}html.w-mod-js:not(.w-mod-ix) [data-w-id="c288d165-b165-99cf-7c9c-3ac8f8ca0f7b"] {-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0;}}</style><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1.6.26/webfont.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script type="text/javascript">WebFont.load({  google: {    families: ["Montserrat:100,100italic,200,200italic,300,300italic,400,400italic,500,500italic,600,600italic,700,700italic,800,800italic,900,900italic"]  }});</script><script src="https://use.typekit.net/itx0npe.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script type="text/javascript">try{Typekit.load();}catch(e){}</script><script type="text/javascript">!function(o,c){var n=c.do