</style></div></div><div class="blogpost-investors-section"><div class="container"><div class="blog-post-wrapper-2 transition mt-3"><div id="content" class="blog-post-content-2"><a id="top" style="background-color:hsla(249.3577981651376, 67.70%, 68.43%, 1.00)" href="/blog-categories-investors/dealflow" class="category-label-2 w-inline-block"><div class="category-label-text-2">dealflow</div></a><h1 class="heading-8">Anthropic Pre-IPO Shares: What Accredited Investors Should Know in 2026</h1><div class="blog-post-info"><div class="w-embed"><style>
