</svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="learn-more-section z-index"><div class="container"><div class="learn-more-wrapper"><div class="keep-learning-div justify-left"><h2 class="universal-header desktop-mb--5rem added-margin-right no-wrap">Keep Learning</h2><a style="background-color:hsla(249.3577981651376, 67.70%, 68.43%, 1.00)" href="/blog-categories-investors/dealflow" class="category-label _w-max w-inline-block"><div class="category-label-text">dealflow</div></a></div><div class="keep-learning-wrapper"><div class="founders-posts-list-wrapper keep-learning w-dyn-list"><div fs-cmsload-element="list" fs-cmsload-mode="load-under" role="list" class="founders-posts grid keep-learning w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="post-wrapper w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/stock-warrants-startup-investing" class="post-link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div class="image-80-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6aa7b7a3e0ad89b3ecba59b2_7ed72802-294e-49f2-a4d8-3781a92aa537.png" loading="lazy" alt="A pixel-art warrant, key, and stack of share certificates." class="image-80"/></div><div class="blog-header font-weight-400 mt mt-1rem">Stock Warrants: A Practical Guide for Startup Investors</div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s margin"><div class="block-text">BY</div><div class="block-text pr-0">Brian Nichols</div></div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s mt"><div class="block-text">TIME</div><div class="block-text pr-0">13</div><div class="block-text pr-0">MIN READ</div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="post-wrapper w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/how-to-get-from-wannabe-to-trusted-expert-or-why-proof-beats-potential" class="post-link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div class="image-80-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6aa78a06a538e0265f5af718_Wanting%20to%20help%20and%20being%20worth%20recommending%20are%20two%20different%20lists%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6aa78a06a538e0265f5af718_Wanting%20to%20help%20and%20being%20worth%20recommending%20are%20two%20different%20lists%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6aa78a06a538e0265f5af718_Wanting%20to%20help%20and%20being%20worth%20recommending%20are%20two%20different%20lists%20(1).png 600w" class="image-80"/></div><div class="blog-header font-weight-400 mt mt-1rem">How to get from wannabe to trusted expert, or why proof beats potential</div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s margin"><div class="block-text">BY</div><div class="block-text pr-0">Brian Nichols</div></div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s mt"><div class="block-text">TIME</div><div class="block-text pr-0">5</div><div class="block-text pr-0">MIN READ</div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="post-wrapper w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/venture-capital-scout-programs" class="post-link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div class="image-80-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6aa271b5af1edef2c9ac8ecd_5bb98c0b-b719-44b3-ad40-f5c4069663e4.png" loading="lazy" alt="An operator compares venture capital scouting with learning to invest as an angel." class="image-80"/></div><div class="blog-header font-weight-400 mt mt-1rem">Venture Capital Scout Programs: 5 Programs Compared</div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s margin"><div class="block-text">BY</div><div class="block-text pr-0">Brian Nichols</div></div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s mt"><div class="block-text">TIME</div><div class="block-text pr-0">15</div><div class="block-text pr-0">MIN READ</div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="post-wrapper w-dyn-item"><a href="/post/deal-flow-management-software-for-angel-investors" class="post-link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div class="image-80-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa050b52dd52/6a9de08c3a7ec68b1cec2efe_1582dc88-69b9-4ce0-aca0-79b39dae2175.png" loading="lazy" alt="Angel investor deal flow moving through a structured review pipeline." class="image-80"/></div><div class="blog-header font-weight-400 mt mt-1rem">Deal Flow Management Software for Angel Investors: 5 Practical Options</div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s margin"><div class="block-text">BY</div><div class="block-text pr-0">Angel Squad</div></div><div class="block opacity-40 font-s mt"><div class="block-text">TIME</div><div class="block-text pr-0">10</div><div class="block-text pr-0">MIN READ</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="newsletter-popup-wrapper"><div class="container fullscreen center"><div data-w-id="2158a066-cfda-8781-57c2-0b620bd6e5c1" class="black-blur"></div><div class="nwesletter-cmp"><div data-w-id="2158a066-cfda-8781-57c2-0b620bd6e5c3" class="newsletter-close-btn"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6331a9a50eb8aa687c52dd23/6331a9a50eb8aa45af52de43_X%20button.svg" loading="lazy" alt="close button" class="newsletter-close-btn-image"/></div><div class="newsletter-heading"><div class="newsletter-heading-text mb-2">Get tactical, BS-free content delivered weekly.</div></div><div class="newsletter-form-wrapper"><div class="newsletter-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-newsletter-form-popup" name="wf-form-newsletter-form-popup" data-name="newsletter-form-popup" method="post" class="newsletter-form" data-wf-page-id="641065e7b5f96375a9b06d5e" data-wf-element-id="a4072cde-e7df-48c8-9302-b4fb0c7889e0"><label class="w-checkbox checkbox align-text"><div class="w-checkbox-input w-checkbox-input--inputType-custom checkbox-2"></div><input name="Founders-2" data-name="Founders 2" lname="Playbook" type="checkbox" link="https://hustlefund.us17.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=6db2909cc0aa273515b8a76f8&amp;amp;id=4db9c87766&amp;amp;f_id=001510e1f0" id="Founders-2" style="opacity:0;position:absolute;z-index:-1"/><span class="checkbox-label max-w w-form-label" for="Founders-2">The Founder Pl